    <node id="License Selection">
      <data key="d0">License Selection</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">License selection is the process of choosing a specific license from multiple options available during the installation of Allplan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9dc41165ce839cf3f850050abd7081e</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888388</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Central File Storage Folder">
      <data key="d0">Central File Storage Folder</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The Central File Storage Folder is where projects and office standards are saved in Allplan 2020.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central File Storage Folder is used to save projects and files for Allplan and can be located on a local machine or network.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9dc41165ce839cf3f850050abd7081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8deeda22c4730643daae705342beefc</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888388</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Local File Storage Folder">
      <data key="d0">Local File Storage Folder</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The Local File Storage Folder synchronizes data with the Central File Storage Folder and is required for accessing online projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The Local File Storage Folder synchronizes data with the Central File Storage Folder and is necessary for accessing online projects on mobile computers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9dc41165ce839cf3f850050abd7081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8deeda22c4730643daae705342beefc</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888388</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Setup Type">
      <data key="d0">Setup Type</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Setup Type consists of various installation options such as Default, Minimum, and Custom for installing Allplan programs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9dc41165ce839cf3f850050abd7081e</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888388</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Allplan Help">
      <data key="d0">Allplan Help</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Allplan Help provides guidance on creating, opening projects, and understanding settings within Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan Help is a resource accessible via the drop-down menu that provides information and assistance regarding the Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan Help provides documentation and references for users to understand various functionalities and settings of the Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan Help provides detailed support documentation and guidance for users of the Allplan software, including instructions on various features.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan Help refers to the documentation that provides guidance on using selection options and direct object modification within the Allplan software.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9dc41165ce839cf3f850050abd7081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87aecad85380c390cbc2374858405d69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c5287c4c8d2cc121dff7af4c8f5b95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28f5266d1ec6c127667f218d268add52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f2c57b3e6ef820340af49795681771f</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896889</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Allplan QuickStart">
      <data key="d0">Allplan QuickStart</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Allplan QuickStart is a resource offering a tutorial to introduce users to the Allplan CAD software.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9dc41165ce839cf3f850050abd7081e</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888388</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Allplan Connect">
      <data key="d0">Allplan Connect</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Allplan Connect is the online platform where users can download guides and share information, aimed at enhancing user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan Connect is the service portal of Allplan that provides additional resources and support.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan Connect is an online platform that provides access to a variety of predefined content and objects for Allplan users.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan Connect refers to online resources linked to Allplan software, enhancing user access to community and assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan Connect is a platform associated with Allplan that facilitates user tools and functionalities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9dc41165ce839cf3f850050abd7081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aef18e4906ae04faffda048cb70ce961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f6d6c0fc9029b0a0cac77b61d25be98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05fcb2b72043f064aaa5a8bc609bc7cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdba2226dec5584f6511d77d2b5f7ad3</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896856</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Bimplus">
      <data key="d0">Bimplus</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Bimplus is an openBIM platform developed by ALLPLAN GmbH that facilitates the exchange of building data across different disciplines. It serves as a collaborative project platform used alongside Allplan for project management and task organization, enhancing project workflows and collaboration within BIM frameworks. Bimplus integrates with Allplan, providing various functionalities, including task management, project synchronization, and data handling.

The platform offers capabilities for inserting profiles and symbols into the Allplan software, contributing to the design processes and enhancing user actions. Bimplus is mentioned as a source for instructions on the use of symbols and for efficient profile insertion into the Allplan library. It is designed to streamline project management tasks, thus improving task workflows and operational efficiency.

In essence, Bimplus operates as a comprehensive tool within the Allplan ecosystem, integrating features for project management and collaborative task management, thereby providing a supportive resource for users involved in architecture and construction projects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9dc41165ce839cf3f850050abd7081e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87aecad85380c390cbc2374858405d69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf93c97b7398da09d1cabc644a3e194&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec22abab62a86e389dc5d86bb0bf9c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1729b2d3689ebe861c41881a390fc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9af0eeaf763231fe31640b724a22aae9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-393bdba2c73740bd161433fc6d6aa8d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-000860ed98e917b7ebb120828d5ce50b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8adfc2a8ed692a488fd180b2300080bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80384e61c69b8525123bddfac6a7f806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4cf5f011c03d3f7d318f9499a6edd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6dfc54cc34be7df573bffd25060a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031abc09fbd44b3ece31b6449c940604&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdba2226dec5584f6511d77d2b5f7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f8869f86a20dcf25febc09d9d190707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff60d8c24018330ad5d1f786c1f8145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cef00cd9dd33e646387968fe293078f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45b1cabd25f8d210e4eb5c4e96aa039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77d89da4c1d2340075bda11a0dcc5eeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab8f70749e69cff7fda1de507e6fcdcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44bd59ccbe0cab28616751e2c2cc91e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a4cd03a65b9dc915cec04e3a5dda465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9316bd775f736c37e856046aa7237e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9ce3a00bca11a70ac1a2d1c6fab790e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922e4b9126761633ec085aaac26c430d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f72a6e939a595903d1409e3e058fcf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db6335795188eff6f459d29076d581f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8a08773aa044ab88848760c734b6ca</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896790</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Drawing Files">
      <data key="d0">Drawing Files</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Drawing Files are integral components within Allplan software, used to create and manage project layouts that contain essential architectural or design data. These files serve as digital representations of architectural or engineering drawings, holding various structural levels, graphical representations, and attributes critical for project design. Drawing Files can be opened, edited, and referenced in a software environment, facilitating the design and documentation processes.

Drawing Files can be thought of as analogous to traditional transparency layers, organizing project designs through a structured approach that allows for the management of object visibility and organization. They typically have a capacity of up to 9999 files and can be organized with layers or numerical identifiers, enhancing the project management workflow within Allplan. Effective management of Drawing Files is crucial, as they are subject to different edit permissions and visibility statuses that need careful handling to optimize collaboration among users.

These digital documents contain graphical information pertinent to building structures, embodying construction designs and specifications relevant to Building Information Modeling (BIM). Drawing Files are utilized in CAD projects and interact with layers to affect the overall design workflow. They may include elements such as 'Basement model' and 'Chimney,' which are listed in tools like ProjectPilot for architectural projects. Additionally, Drawing Files can be exported into various formats, accommodating diverse organizational needs.

In essence, Drawing Files are fundamental to the digital design landscape in Allplan, representing not only the visual aspects of a project but also serving as critical tools for managing project structures and guidelines efficiently. Their effective use is vital for ensuring accurate documentation and enhancing overall project management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a16b1e5756a6e58b24d2d8ec53fdb945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ed2f4c4b8b09ff37fd8fcc9a82daa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a9230f90f86536e2d89709e70964c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-338775c6247efd1422755d0684c5914e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5493e550e39dd75b531fbc279a9ede75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-722696e14943f4546267ecafc68e9e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d59584cb0afc041ab57b7f98deb5234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a3196d9c94c23fbe21c202d6923681&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33e821c3b421b7baca8cbf0848f0bdab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-560d69182ab5365b678a148d9b6e2e37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dfa5fe91c361d4a67860ecb32d1a0e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae7b7ad2a4de3ec2e345c55268daab5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4113c6c45ee235152f4e29b16a43fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfe9f0600b71ac1fb6333f1bc72307a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-471a28c31749d23bb6aca95f45a148c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a8f0f648530375ec7ff455ceff4d6ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b95a85ff07713cc0f1adb8712b58bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbbd564c80da8a545228ae041a60c486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdaeced48a09bf3e6cabc0558e70ecf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656c6ea66b577915e78e14b99fcff201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0003317cc231a35911e26a266b87c25f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d692d889f45fd000f1ad654707af6f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33cd2d3ca266bb991eee00d3d8527fc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17583b10964c1e5e228f4f3703d84910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0433c102924e3e18af2ecc35cca067d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2531b166525237884bbbf813c7b6ce26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d229ff07439ada86c42a9e43bdaccd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-900dab27472a9806ed3ac086b9249508&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64a391cb4a4c94fa59fc6f439fea9eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2178b2cb7ae5eb73332368dadd64d9a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3347e46b091e6d44734f25df9aa8eb3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4214a7ad25394b1516ea471827743477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdce630877092efc4b68b70b07c7a1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3483e846d3a461436f2e30d70ffcc1c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb38dce302a6fcd1fc4b9c0473f93438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-513d72347d79f22f5f1d7f70d974dcd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36c3f2b433b78adbb71a8d05d151351&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-935cacdbf30f098651e73da157d12d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b79e56c5ee638a38fe189b40c7e665a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b12ac308c348c167a0c3b407e59a72a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea012b45890e8cbe0fb63b8fc9b1affd</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896633</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="NDW Files">
      <data key="d0">NDW Files</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">NDW files are specific types of drawing files in Allplan that require manual saving before exiting the program.&lt;SEP&gt;NDW files are specific file formats used in Allplan for managing data within documents and projects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a16b1e5756a6e58b24d2d8ec53fdb945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a9230f90f86536e2d89709e70964c9</data>
