      <data key="d0">Detached House Example</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Detached House Example is an illustration provided within Allplan to demonstrate the use of a building structure for project management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-83ed2f4c4b8b09ff37fd8fcc9a82daa6</data>
