    <node id="Windows Drivers">
      <data key="d0">Windows Drivers</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Windows drivers are used to print documents directly from Windows applications, enabling access to configured printers and print settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Windows drivers are utilized for printing layouts from the Layout Editor in the Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;Windows Drivers are software components that facilitate communication between Windows operating systems and various hardware devices, including printers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-461b65dc8290feb9444a308b8425f47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-451be9692297c28020f54c8273fd6dca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708f844a6d6fc01b9fdca980f9c3b649</data>
