    <node id="Allplan Vector Drivers">
      <data key="d0">Allplan Vector Drivers</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Allplan vector drivers facilitate printing layouts in Allplan, particularly with newer element types like OLE objects and bitmaps.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan vector drivers are specific drivers used for handling printing tasks within the described document context.</data>
