      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Raster drivers in Allplan are used for printing high-quality large-format drawings and layouts on HP DesignJet printers.&lt;SEP&gt;Raster drivers are a type of printer driver mentioned in relation to Allplan software, providing specifications for printing.&lt;SEP&gt;Raster Drivers are components discussed in the context of connecting and managing printers within the Allplan Software framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Raster Drivers are linked to instructions within Allplan software, detailing their use in printer configuration.</data>
