      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Output channels are defined in the Services application, allowing printers to be configured for specific tasks in Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;Output channels are mentioned in the analysis as part of the detailed usage instructions related to Allplan's printing capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Output Channels refers to various mechanisms related to printing processes discussed in the context of Allplan's printer driver capabilities.</data>
