      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Desktop Environment refers to the user interface of Allplan where options for editing and direct object modification are available.&lt;SEP&gt;The Desktop Environment refers to the graphical user interface and environment for users to interact with their computer systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The desktop environment refers to the graphical user interface in which handles operate and interact with user elements.</data>
