      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Track Tracing Page in Allplan allows users to turn off options related to track tracing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Track Tracing Page is a settings interface within a software application that provides options to customize track tracing in a desktop environment.</data>
