    <node id="Context Toolbar">
      <data key="d0">Context Toolbar</data>
      <data key="d1">tool</data>
      <data key="d2">The Context Toolbar in Allplan provides quick access to editing tools when a user selects an element.&lt;SEP&gt;The Context Toolbar is a user interface element providing tools for editing and manipulating selected items.&lt;SEP&gt;The Context Toolbar is a software feature that facilitates various editing functions, crucial for user interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Context Toolbar is discussed in adjacent pages as a tool related to modifying elements within the software.&lt;SEP&gt;The Context Toolbar is a tool discussed in relation to its functionalities in editing elements within the software.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-82cbcdc0a3c08b89e366f56c7b12be7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03833b31b2891d602b91a99573458723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762d374635bb2b7f99f859ce63a3fc57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d1fa09b23ca8aa8eef8fc88d496d597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fc5161861531710c469a7ee8a1f087</data>
