    <node id="Dialog Box">
      <data key="d0">Dialog Box</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dialog Box is an essential user interface component within Allplan, an architectural design software that facilitates various design tasks. It serves multiple functions, including enabling users to define keyboard shortcuts, customize settings for tools, and interact with input fields. The Dialog Box is characterized as a pop-up interface element situated in the design workspace, which can confirm entries or present options for user decisions.

In addition to its basic functionalities, specific Dialog Boxes, such as the one labeled "Dialog line," provide fields for entering offsets, thus allowing users to input precise parameters relevant to their designs. Moreover, the Dialog Box displays settings options and properties for various design elements, such as rectangular shapes, enhancing user engagement with the software's design capabilities.

Important to project management, the Dialog Box also indicates the validation status of structural levels and drawing file assignments. It facilitates the selection of drawing file statuses and manages filesets, ensuring that users are well-informed about their project organization. Furthermore, it communicates error messages regarding restrictions within Allplan, thereby maintaining integrity in design processes. Lastly, the Dialog Box presents choices and configurations for importing files, reinforcing its role as a versatile tool in user interaction and design management.

Overall, the Dialog Box in Allplan is a multifaceted interface element that greatly enhances the user experience by integrating a range of functions from configuration management to error reporting and user guidance in the design environment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-338775c6247efd1422755d0684c5914e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b532fa4a8ab92ded3fea1d57304eeffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae7b7ad2a4de3ec2e345c55268daab5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316e2dc0c778330142f07802c67ebd86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d66b0c1cc0e3a04b3d3716ebb8c3e26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3b11bd7057b051ed2f2e394097f8ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6bb3704ef3f257e8d32aef88dafc86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeaa37c59f36c7368264d42473294600&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fd23629614922098d992bcd4a623393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a559f748b3bdf7387cf1b1f8ee8d46</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896719</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Actionbar">
      <data key="d0">Actionbar</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Actionbar is a user interface component within the Allplan software, primarily designed to enhance user interaction by organizing tools and functionalities essential for various design and modeling tasks. It serves a critical role in facilitating user navigation through the application by structuring tools according to specific roles, tasks, and focus areas relevant to architectural and engineering design.

The Actionbar includes several task areas and a horizontal toolbar layout, grouping tools that streamline actions such as selecting and managing design elements. It integrates familiar editing tools directly linked to user-selected entities, significantly improving the editing and management process. Additionally, the Actionbar is crucial for accessing essential editing features, modeling activities, and defining symbols. This combination reinforces its significance in delivering a seamless user experience, ultimately boosting productivity in architectural projects.

Furthermore, the Actionbar supports user customization through features like the Actionbar Configurator, which allows users to tailor the interface to their preferences, enhancing interaction and functionality. The presence of icons representing different tools arranged in categories facilitates quick access to necessary options. Notably, the Actionbar can also be associated with functionalities such as saving configurations, exporting roles, and managing tools efficiently.

In summary, the Actionbar is an integral component of the Allplan user interface that organizes various tools and options, facilitating not only navigation but also overall task management, thereby enhancing usability and productivity for users engaged in design and architectural work.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63113ce4c55fd340029d2a7657821c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43949300eb25c19d8895e4becd1bdee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87aecad85380c390cbc2374858405d69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82cbcdc0a3c08b89e366f56c7b12be7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03833b31b2891d602b91a99573458723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b532fa4a8ab92ded3fea1d57304eeffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc2e5e1cca4bececa7176b1cd5853d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc8dbb1ae85aa5a5ee5c845f4b8bbfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d202d87f74ec6d653a0d9a932427c930&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d305d677976b85ecf574260a9460d5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfac8b75410f9e9fa0a25fdb3d365c19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c63378d2861e5872e217e66366c405b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246815af5194a5328daf62dbd8cb24be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd56a3df93eab6c5b12ab5d96730cbdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bda40b2e734e908e9b2972cc7ad3525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10c213bf3e73dbb3668162f050af15d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ee10b47fc43369c68b38c573d6fd4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25cab05b4e5d13c2f8b0d5bfd3afc5da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a05e93f0e688a92715cf960bc9488f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f1c1dffb20e9037822fb3685bc70cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85eefa32fd6ee004534d2333ac9741fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b8c205c8612c072166b688afee2ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67a50ed6b2a13c3444d6060a41c4478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fdd44bd887b5adeb1adf20548cfb587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39a8300245bae535a3b0d6edd5975f58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8abe6d06e8f4b2b0dc2022595033a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bba124916d2e6dfe20144108953191a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4183d245cd40501723af13ea8656197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329b078a4f7ec71384ebf557857c6e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d199aeaa23602c11381a2a0f4085f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa02d45747fcd51f30e23c86b2c729ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d368cfc5037c738c5aa1853e7ce0782e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ec08840c3fa4e52e44aa4c6e2af111&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e6b80e48bef3738c39a27291a07173f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7aa60924b27638a18e328e8dac3e2719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c269cc706bdc9bae0b911e13534c7ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c36ab84e987861cbb78ee2d63372f5cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79cc7f4e1a32f2bd4c7cbebeac08c301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdba2226dec5584f6511d77d2b5f7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2811ca6e09d4513b3fef90682a011dbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1a8cd52b8c13347584dd07d1cc6082a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0e957393684b272e0278e8a908a2f09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b88363080af7a831ae295ad788a5e58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f401ead0c0a7da4fd8575f768c665a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2682cda91fcc66490a3823382618a08a</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896648</data>
