      <data key="d0">HP DesignJet 650C</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">HP DesignJet 650C is a type of printer mentioned as having specific setting requirements and functions for optimal printing results.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e1b20c02cb1df7f4a3acfb70d457cbf</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
