      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Circle is a geometric shape that can be created as a design entity in Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;The 'Circle' is illustrated by a red arc featuring blue handles, with angular measurements and radius displayed for manipulation in the diagram.&lt;SEP&gt;A circle is a shape consisting of all points equidistant from a center point, often used in geometry and design.</data>
