      <data key="d2">Display Sequence Defaults refer to the predetermined values assigned to different types of elements created in Allplan, determining their visual stacking order.&lt;SEP&gt;Display sequence defaults refer to the systematic organization of default values and modification steps for elements within Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;Display Sequence Defaults refer to the preset configurations for displaying elements within the Allplan software, which are important for user management of architectural designs.</data>
