      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Curve Approximation refers to the process of representing a curve using a defined number of segments to improve accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Curve approximation deals with methods for representing complex curves in a simpler form for modeling purposes.</data>
