    <node id="Segments in Circle">
      <data key="d0">Segments in Circle</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Segments in Circle defines the number of segments that can approximate a full circle, affecting its geometric representation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00307343bc370b11443bafa835be22b1</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888399</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Element Filter">
      <data key="d0">Element Filter</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Element Filter is a technique that allows the omission of specific elements during area detection, improving processing efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00307343bc370b11443bafa835be22b1</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888399</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Hatching Styles">
      <data key="d0">Hatching Styles</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Hatching Styles includes various patterns and styles used to fill areas in architectural documents, enhancing visual representation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00307343bc370b11443bafa835be22b1</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888399</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Surface Element">
      <data key="d0">Surface Element</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Surface Element refers to a variety of materials and patterns applied to areas in design software to differentiate or highlight sections.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00307343bc370b11443bafa835be22b1</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888399</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Hatching Properties">
      <data key="d0">Hatching Properties</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Hatching Properties define how hatching behaves in relation to scale and representation in layouts.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatching properties relate to design characteristics discussed in the context of technical drawings, influencing design properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatching properties refer to the characteristics and features of hatching in design, which can be affected by various scaling factors in layouts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00307343bc370b11443bafa835be22b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3265487686a9beb9757fd06291bb5ba5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dce14303f72c84623180b1b414da408</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896775</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Format Definition Tab">
      <data key="d0">Format Definition Tab</data>
      <data key="d1">interface</data>
      <data key="d2">The Format Definition tab allows users to specify how format properties of elements are to be matched according to layers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef853aad5cd628db1d2c34ebbb5835e3</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888399</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Select Layer/Visibility Tab">
      <data key="d0">Select Layer/Visibility Tab</data>
      <data key="d1">interface</data>
      <data key="d2">The Select Layer/Visibility tab is used to set specific format properties for visibility and layering in ProjectPilot.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef853aad5cd628db1d2c34ebbb5835e3</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763888399</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="User Interface">
      <data key="d0">User Interface</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The User Interface (UI) of Allplan is a crucial component of the software that facilitates user interaction. It consists of various elements that create a layout and design aimed at improving usability and efficiency while users navigate the application. Key features include the toolbar menu, which provides access to different tools, a Welcome screen for introduction and navigation, and a design workspace where users can manipulate projects.

The User Interface comprises a range of interactive components, including dialog boxes, menus, palettes, and toolbars, essential for executing commands and managing element properties. Elements like the Actionbar, the Find dialog box, and the Properties Palette enhance the user's ability to customize their experience. The interface is designed to guide users effectively through the software’s functionalities, including layer management and viewport arrangement, which are critical for architectural design tasks.

The visual design of the User Interface emphasizes clarity and functionality, showcasing design elements that cater to user needs. This includes minimalist aesthetics with clean layouts and intuitive navigation paths. The UI also addresses aspects such as angle adjustments and setting properties like line spacing, ensuring that users have the tools available to optimize their designs.

Overall, the User Interface serves as the space where interactions between users and the Allplan software occur. Its design significantly affects user experience and productivity, providing various interactive tools and features that ultimately enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of design tasks within the application.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef853aad5cd628db1d2c34ebbb5835e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d3d7723ac4866caa16109031e971f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17c659d529ac707dbae01a6773c0c4d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a3196d9c94c23fbe21c202d6923681&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b043aca48744d9fa6699c3bb61efe60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b97614e25388842c30e39c49a1e82bc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d46a5818163872a3bd0aa51e3812488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bea4ecbf369f8e5a0a1e8e93a7608c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246815af5194a5328daf62dbd8cb24be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbe8e0a1a8f597ee2c2d652d6af07b9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb63f807aff4044f3e7485565f1dbc9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ee1b2c794ab3e4a39960b9797ed5aab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55fc07062252f4c1c4c435c8b418f9dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f38cf3ba0f8cec23986e4542fb4b7a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d982638b45d2a757601df8d03bf2ee4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b6cbdb85b0a4f42ca78c9fb64912931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bc5ccd35718eaf0c8bcbb5b6b0ba661&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867c488f07877357a11b851e2cdc9b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0fdcae1fb9712e5a27ca1634779dc11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc5b6b3a2775affb0d58bb05d664df8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-871076f628e01ac2f1cf011805e8dee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abb5cb6ebe596c912584de0a4457bb16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-916b361a8f27ae8dddeb444aa89deb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4640cdeb03c859362166d77c5c7f6353&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea6874f69449311da64044dd62af723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a444081fee7147f9b9bd39e8e04ad22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61c80c48e779ad023af2379778b857d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1612203bc5d933422c3ccc84f7986ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eee637b59b6ed6c157aae67c5875def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdce630877092efc4b68b70b07c7a1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad9e677335fcea1e7fe48a3dcb8adde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c27b295cd59b8d3b2f14a9e71c81c73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5c6341605bfb4d0e61bfa91bb5ffcb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-584f25579b532bc080392b89b5241043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db13cd4f3d63a7d5220eeab390c23fbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69f1b391e6c2463c9cf5668fdd797933&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5be17e6e205509889b8ba2a61070a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-045789d54d9c59dfae128c442d815e63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9138f9804e5b8156f4540c63e24f1fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a893d16b0a9cdad9f06bff3dc372a370&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625701e5ecf336500c6ce794dba12de8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d348a021fa662b95c5f1d68673e66bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeaa37c59f36c7368264d42473294600&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a05e93f0e688a92715cf960bc9488f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3bf8515f342502ea30e1d362975d491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fdd44bd887b5adeb1adf20548cfb587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8abe6d06e8f4b2b0dc2022595033a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d368cfc5037c738c5aa1853e7ce0782e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e6b80e48bef3738c39a27291a07173f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40c1cae9f8b555bba50ef18e59362ad9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c36ab84e987861cbb78ee2d63372f5cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f989a36d1a66c933778910096bf2ea3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf01747cde1a4424912f6e5932eb3786&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a840120e862e758547b6c08892ccdfa1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2139799dad0bb14bb21630ef1e99275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67011f7a75a85372a25d4ae9f8c2a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5efc6fb4de4f5c15827fe552ce16b42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d38d6185475b7afa04ee148f69ebcec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea012b45890e8cbe0fb63b8fc9b1affd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdba2226dec5584f6511d77d2b5f7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4633e4c71d2db6ddf873662d52285a65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96e049ecada2a58e9cb999bfcd0afb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d099869dd762f58622ec8ec268721766&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a71675f17feba1decb70c72f6bba6979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21ec646093544919261e2d96ec344652&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3c2130d3d4faa7b4c250d2efa11d751&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7745fefa6cd1d68692f85c9696c2838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29308dce9ddeda00822de86e6d1dd129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07dd4e386e68725e917970842292a8a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d885b9e6318ddf383ed03ed1ecdd05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b88363080af7a831ae295ad788a5e58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9f60b9aafff7f66fa66003b4db86794&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a13cf655e675b370544f46ffa8a3b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c46f34c6b261b8f317bfaa2af9de2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7a6fb96d2c4d3280b5d585d719a7c55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e05575fdf899295156f6bf0490548a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-badee94ea3a627e760da71db876d2f67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a789f6f9ddfb3c5b68ed9d65b75d54e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-199627324ec70005570ae0ac3cd720b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62793877b09c086c32620ffe91719d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d71107f0a79ff7cc43c431cc90d16de0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f36077886a97e5a1c3fe45c15f6d92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc81bbce7f6732d5f7cf3b0c3a9f19e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a11034421bff5eb8de0b9e4403a5ea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd4f98001bcdfeee78fe603290a396e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92133cc3204e73ae60da3b5bc728472d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ebd6462bdaa0e470ddfc5d515f0db5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-494c6745934c204a449c6f98129e911d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9097ec7ad88804b74031e4853e83ccff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f3f5e2b958b9de1d8184aeca6f12df8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1ccad7d6a02dd9097c16e41067ab58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d42a5eabe03f05462c39f760738d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70959841805b8219f606b6007eb6012e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1863d3f8291fd53e99cd9aa0692c462&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcb972311deabb1954d721aa1149e525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee381f225589a5bc5741093a94e267b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2785c23eea558e541a95481334ca5baa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38056f6be64c6032e65bcc1f59693aef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45b1cabd25f8d210e4eb5c4e96aa039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-733638abd7ec99e44a6cfa99ee6014c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d19f218012d660f7aab6742d06b028fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2953dc1c146d2c4762eb62a61e3e10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08b9a1671199a929dedf70ef971350f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e272a0453cd6a3118ca7ab3fcea51f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60190843a0f358ee5d312009e08ebfba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-774eb50b4e3a36640e5267d8ce8e7c57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75f8f337295af3186f163c6ffe1116b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e764fa1898cd1f0edbac9c371599f51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e99a1900958135051554ed048311c31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0846d10978818ac5ba9ce58425bc50e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a98a0ae9b9a97657e6eae4d7f5089ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9e143bbb0781977a04fcd604ac05e33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-498a02f33624e89881923310f78aca92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93a6b6a1910ba10faa14c33bb8a835c4</data>
