    <node id="Installation Instructions">
      <data key="d0">Installation Instructions</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Installation Instructions outline the necessary steps for successfully setting up Allplan 2020 on a user's system.&lt;SEP&gt;Installation instructions are guidelines meant to assist users in the process of setting up Allplan 2020, mentioned as part of the surrounding content.&lt;SEP&gt;Installation instructions refer to the detailed guidelines provided within software documentation that explain how to properly install a software application, including specifics about system requirements and compatibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Installation instructions refer to the guidelines and requirements necessary to install the Allplan software properly.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-16d3d7723ac4866caa16109031e971f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b5770ce7b18930f5cb24790f637343c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16df2c3b8deab5b6f252494c54478272&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7928fb896b0f84be4bcbaccec9d24ff</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896867</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Filter Options">
      <data key="d0">Filter Options</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Filter Options are settings that allow users to refine the data displayed or processed based on specific criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Filter options refer to the various criteria and selections available to users during the installation process in architectural software.&lt;SEP&gt;Filter Options relates to a systematic approach for categorizing various criteria used in applications, including color, layer, and architectural elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Filter options relate to the functionalities available for graphical elements and architectural documentation, aiming to assist users in selecting and defining parameters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a007e42b9b683c4bb5c145f80014d5b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4537c77961461a375e238a73a8da24ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bcddf0c6ec646e1984289b91dd6953b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea87f57165f1732764ed72b71196f07f</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896672</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Layout">
      <data key="d0">Layout</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Layout pertains to the arrangement of components and documents within a given space, emphasized for export and printing.&lt;SEP&gt;Layout refers to the physical organization and positioning of elements within a design, impacting the visual aspects of hatching properties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a007e42b9b683c4bb5c145f80014d5b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3265487686a9beb9757fd06291bb5ba5</data>
