    <node id="Connect Palette">
      <data key="d0">Connect Palette</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Connect Palette provides direct access to content available on Allplan Connect.&lt;SEP&gt;The Connect Palette provides access to content on Allplan Connect and requires user authentication.&lt;SEP&gt;Connect Palette is a user interface component allowing access to various modules or functions within the system.</data>
