    <node id="Architectural Components">
      <data key="d0">Architectural Components</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Architectural Components are parts used in designing buildings and structures, including patterns and constants in plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural Components refer to the various elements involved in building design, which can be filtered using design software.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural Components are elements in design where patterns can be applied, such as walls, enhancing the visual and functional aspects of constructions.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural components refer to structural elements in architecture, which are impacted by layout patterns and design strategies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a007e42b9b683c4bb5c145f80014d5b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bf0d199f8a6c6b2db7e1ece08f8e75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cab00b8e8a73fee64ae77a8cb78d4c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b515f42548636fceb815d3bb5060718&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d222e0ba3ea158698894e838b854e877</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896691</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Layer Palette">
      <data key="d0">Layer Palette</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Layer Palette provides tools for managing various layers within the document, enabling users to organize their designs effectively.</data>
