    <node id="Tools Palette">
      <data key="d0">Tools Palette</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Tools Palette provides quick access to activate various tools in the Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tools Palette is a user interface element that provides various tools for user interactions, capable of displaying text and icons for functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tools Palette is another part of Allplan's user interface, designed to provide users with tools for various tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Tools Palette refers to the collection of design tools available in the software interface for creating and altering visual elements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tools Palette is an essential component of the Allplan software interface, used for managing tools and features during operation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tools Palette is a specific type of palette mentioned that aids in navigation and customization within a user interface.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tools Palette encompasses interface features for editing models, including list boxes, tool searches, tabs, and viewport management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b2e09e8bba60f1d58ef71be4e357ed2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1729b2d3689ebe861c41881a390fc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d19f218012d660f7aab6742d06b028fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0938efbf06e3d980c6f900e209b135c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1531f3518c2d5fa3c2f8c42e7c04cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2953dc1c146d2c4762eb62a61e3e10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-045fab9a616da31eaa9792e972bfef42</data>
