    <node id="Element Selection">
      <data key="d0">Element Selection</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Element Selection is a method and tool used within design software, notably in Allplan, for choosing specific design entities to display in a viewport while temporarily hiding others. This feature facilitates user interaction with design elements by enabling the selection and manipulation of specific components in 3D modeling environments.

The functionality of Element Selection is commonly associated with library navigation, where users can choose particular elements from a broader collection within the software environment. It is integral to managing project resources and methodologies, providing users with various options for selecting elements through different methods such as filters and brackets.

In the context of 3D modeling software, Element Selection aids in the effective manipulation and organization of design components, allowing for a more streamlined workflow. The process includes procedures outlined in related content, highlighting the operational aspects of selecting elements within the interface. Element selection is not only essential for design accuracy but also enhances user experience by providing clear methods for interacting with various design entities. 

As a critical function within design and engineering workspaces, Element Selection encompasses both basic and advanced functionalities, ensuring that users can efficiently navigate their projects and focus on the elements that matter most.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b2e09e8bba60f1d58ef71be4e357ed2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfac8b75410f9e9fa0a25fdb3d365c19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd31efff73cdeece22a05f5ec7b51a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19807915ea52d6607cd1aa32207d700a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c63378d2861e5872e217e66366c405b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dd9aa94aab594fbf7969b531d375552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91ff5bf9a308f02afa133830a8149bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64220d8c6a507cb0154d5cab89b3a5f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d7adf0f26ef1d1fb72de6d793184a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae2a0899855006d406e2e9526250f116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90bb3d06baf9abaed674a28c8bb22a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-552715e948e01f475b4d3509dc02cd14</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896642</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
