      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Reference Surface is a local surface in a plane model used for defining heights and connections.&lt;SEP&gt;Reference surfaces are crucial components in modeling software, serving as the basis for various design elements that users manipulate.</data>
