      <data key="d2">Architecture refers to one of the roles in Allplan, where tools are provided for designing SmartParts.&lt;SEP&gt;Architecture is one of the roles available within the dropdown menu under the Actionbar, indicating a specific area of focus.&lt;SEP&gt;Architecture is a selected role in the Actionbar Configuration interface, indicating a focus on design tasks related to buildings and structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Architecture is a subcategory under Bonus Tools in the Modules panel, indicated as selected with a blue background.</data>
