      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">PDF Data includes information formatted in Portable Document Format, widely used for document exchange and storage.&lt;SEP&gt;PDF data is a type of content that is handled within Allplan for the purpose of managing architectural information.&lt;SEP&gt;PDF Data refers to a type of file format mentioned in the context of importing/exporting within the documentation that surrounds Allplan 2020.&lt;SEP&gt;PDF data refers to graphical information that can be imported and exported within Allplan, enhancing data transfer among stakeholders.</data>
