    <node id="System Requirements">
      <data key="d0">System Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">System Requirements pertain to the essential specifications that a user's computer must meet to effectively install and run the software Allplan 2020. These requirements encompass both hardware and software components necessary for the successful operation of the application. Specifically, System Requirements define the conditions and configurations needed to ensure proper functionality and performance of Allplan 2020.

The specifications outlined in the System Requirements include details essential for installation, ensuring that users have the appropriate environment set up for the software to operate efficiently. While some descriptions suggest that additional specifications might not be thoroughly detailed in certain analyses, it remains clear that adherence to these outlined requirements is crucial for successful software deployment.

In summary, System Requirements provide a comprehensive guideline that delineates what is necessary in terms of computer specifications, emphasizing the importance of meeting these parameters to facilitate effective installation and operation of Allplan 2020.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b8deeda22c4730643daae705342beefc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac52f95c97cb7e36a52a886f937957b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38c581ecc7883a1589167ad2507e7df4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e263f80fd4de82a8e01b94df3ba5302f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38c63719922f72258376722643e7f55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9673664b6f86b3113d2e4807e6a2ee4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-993bdca911885adb926a114a333379a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bad7e6be988784a77f8cd26ea5ed266&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c05a7dacce3d5c549208ee80e94f837&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16df2c3b8deab5b6f252494c54478272&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c3a6a8ab58f516bdb49fb00685dc999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a267fbcc220db32c81af146cd87d31a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a8cdc1b7d8617a10dbcc75ab0f6957</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896741</data>
