      <data key="d2">A drawing file contains graphical and data information used in Allplan for architectural designs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Drawing File is an element mentioned in the context of the content analysis, likely related to user interface design or graphical representation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Drawing File is indicated by a small rectangular icon in the image, which may signify a document related to structural design.</data>
