    <node id="Normal XRefs">
      <data key="d0">Normal XRefs</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Normal XRefs are standard references to external documents in Allplan which have certain restrictions regarding functionality and visibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Normal XRefs are the standard options in Allplan that come with various limitations in functionalities compared to Advanced XRefs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2705dc98383cde48e236bb2ab1b3a5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba56bb28bde779ccfd0b2be72d920734</data>
