    </node>
    <node id="Advanced XRefs">
      <data key="d0">Advanced XRefs</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Advanced XRefs are enhanced references to documents in Allplan that do not increase data volume and allow for more flexible usage than normal XRefs.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced XRefs represent a superior set of features in Allplan, allowing enhanced editing, area detection, and flexible point snapping.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2705dc98383cde48e236bb2ab1b3a5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba56bb28bde779ccfd0b2be72d920734</data>
