      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Actionbar Configuration refers to an alternative palette layout customization in Allplan, which may differ from the default configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;Actionbar Configuration is an interface from a software application used for managing roles and configuring tasks within the application.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar Configuration refers to the user interface settings within the Allplan software application, designed for managing roles and configuration tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ec1729b2d3689ebe861c41881a390fc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f0a9f2fd1c249a810ff8197b457681&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0386115ae26e321feecb48cffce34026</data>
