      <data key="d2">The Modules Palette enables users to navigate between different task areas efficiently.&lt;SEP&gt;Task Areas are specific segments within the Actionbar that help organize user roles and tasks within Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;Task areas in the Actionbar interface represent different functionalities and tools, facilitating user interaction and organization.&lt;SEP&gt;Task Areas refer to specific categories of tasks available within the Actionbar Configuration interface, including various options like '2D Areas' and '3D Objects'.</data>
