    <node id="Layering">
      <data key="d0">Layering</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Layering is an essential aspect in CAD software that involves organizing different elements for coherent document presentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Layering refers to the method of organizing drawings or elements within CAD files, which is integral to the functionality of the software.</data>
