    <node id="Text Formatting">
      <data key="d0">Text Formatting</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Text formatting refers to the arrangement of text characteristics such as pen thickness, line color, and style, which are addressed in the context of Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;Text formatting entails the various ways of presenting text, including style and emphasis, within Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;Text Formatting consists of settings that affect how text is displayed in documents created using Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;Text formatting refers to the various options available in Allplan software to adjust the visual presentation of textual information, influencing elements like dimension lines and dimension text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f9dd28f0f469bfa0a19a2e734ea5355a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6abd232f051ae36261abe24ae2c56cc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e1d000e98787b8964ca733d51f71fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-424ea6f6da4f8d6ec31ae51128cd584f</data>
