    <node id="Allplan Software">
      <data key="d0">Allplan Software</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Allplan Software is a comprehensive architectural design and project management tool that offers a wide range of functionalities crucial for both novice and experienced users. Specifically, it facilitates project structuring, data management, and design automation, making it particularly valuable in the fields of architecture and engineering. The software includes various advanced tools and features, such as user interface customization, direct object modification, geometric element management, and functionalities for visual layering and hierarchy.

Allplan Software also functions as a CAD application, providing tools for architectural design and construction planning. It includes capabilities such as polygonization, area detection, and specific design tasks requiring precise mathematical inputs. Its design features extend to managing library elements, template functionalities, and integrating smart symbols to enhance workflow consistency. Additionally, users can take advantage of wizards and palettes that streamline interaction and task management.

For effective operation, Allplan Software necessitates understanding installation processes and user navigation. It includes detailed installation instructions aimed at optimizing user experience and operational capabilities, highlighting the importance of proper setup before delving into advanced functionalities. Users engage with features related to file management, including backup options and file saving protocols, critical for project continuity.

In the realm of printing and layout design, Allplan Software encompasses tools for creating and managing print files, including connecting raster drivers and managing print profiles. This functionality aligns with its overarching goal of facilitating efficient design processes and enhancing user productivity across various architectural and construction tasks.

Moreover, Allplan Software contributes to Building Information Modeling (BIM) practices, supporting data exchange, IFC object types management, and collaboration through shared design data. This positions Allplan Software not only as a design tool but also as a vital part of modern architectural workflows, ensuring that users can manage complex projects effectively while maintaining a high standard of technical accuracy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c111d4254c90980530d7aa82bd978662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6abd232f051ae36261abe24ae2c56cc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05e5481e89f4d2db7d1cdb8be7ef7ee0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-696b895267139307fa5be3f42205931a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b043aca48744d9fa6699c3bb61efe60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91e0c1144d529e5ae94644497f689216&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0202d05f357226b16b746554c9e7e72d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4afc17196d5e967b29b333d801f917f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575527346b06bf6c21d3b7006a63ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a609f5a782fefb851075f82fbc80ac1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04f0843c62c2c16c706779b2ac87f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4012b27b6c7c8ef787dad7737712bf80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1798a5b98f689569497cc66fb113a34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4113c6c45ee235152f4e29b16a43fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27686492e0f58768087405a853ae44ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a8f0f648530375ec7ff455ceff4d6ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e58bf3624678c397118ee66ca217bee1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f94cfcadb55fd4dbaf92ab9ca0a13da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a444081fee7147f9b9bd39e8e04ad22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a442c12af4d7d4ba4f158a15f640e0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65c7c44cbdfab1a5c57999e6f5732d50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4152424e127dd305bed7dcaa03e8d422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5f2725ec80b19a946f5fd60262a0ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60f2f16a99d8ed5edf18e8f8fefa073c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00c09e03bfb6f7b7d1520b2a600e03b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa5f19da184966b9597323c17e4c8365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ebdb2951ad2bbbb60ea48469cd679ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57a35bafd15f27dd80792f85ac68957f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca66e6554489f6f847a5278aa05254a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7460ea58ee99d764421fc3d9f144da87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7508773c6f055dacc49fabc771f103bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447e96feaa6ad1059f430f86df36d17f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a653d4534e4d996656ae034933b2ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12246b3f189f72274b1bd73c6d7d959a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2bff0956001a90e38664cf455131ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93e1740be0b90b51787be4cb4fb06e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84211271d6db79a13c3b79e71b211d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4103b1a835dd909ab40cb8c514cd99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38cc0e76b7034294cac5a6997d79f80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bda40b2e734e908e9b2972cc7ad3525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ac92338ff12f