    <node id="Data Handling">
      <data key="d0">Data Handling</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Data handling refers to the procedures and practices involved in managing and utilizing data within Allplan, emphasizing effective backups and user actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Handling involves methods and practices for organizing and processing data within design workflows in CAD systems, which is essential for collaborative projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Handling encompasses the processes involved in managing data, including manipulation, storage, and transmission in software applications.</data>
