    <node id="Layer Format Properties">
      <data key="d0">Layer Format Properties</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Layer Format Properties pertain to the attributes determining how elements inherit styles from different layers in design software.&lt;SEP&gt;Layer Format Properties are settings that determine how formatting is applied to project layers within the Allplan software.</data>
