    <node id="Format Toolbar">
      <data key="d0">Format Toolbar</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Format Toolbar is a user interface element that allows users to manage formatting options, suggested values with respect to layers being selected.&lt;SEP&gt;The Format Toolbar is a feature within Allplan that allows users to apply proposed values based on selected layers.</data>
