    <node id="Beginner/Intermediate Users">
      <data key="d0">Beginner/Intermediate Users</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Beginner and intermediate users are individuals who may require foundational information regarding installation procedures to better understand complex topics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3312cf4fab55427b11a562c6e43da9c0</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896625</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Software Interface">
      <data key="d0">Software Interface</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Software Interface refers to the digital environment where users interact with various software applications, particularly within the context of design software like Allplan. This interface encompasses a range of functionalities that enable users to perform actions such as manipulating 3D models, navigating design options, and managing library content. Integral features of the Software Interface include the Actionbar, navigation panes, and various tools for design tasks, all of which enhance user interaction by providing a cohesive layout of menu options and tools.

The Software Interface serves as a visual representation for users, displaying a hierarchical structure typical of software navigation systems. It includes mechanisms for managing layers, properties, and technical documentation, allowing for intuitive access to essential functionalities. Specific features such as sorting controls, labeled input fields, and element selection functionalities are all part of this interactive environment, which focuses on design and modification tasks as well as library management.

Moreover, the Software Interface also relates to the manipulation of design elements, including point placement and the use of offset tools. It is depicted as a graphical layout that showcases settings and configurations vital for user interaction in CAD or architectural design applications. Collectively, these attributes underline the importance of the Software Interface as a platform that enables users to efficiently navigate, organize, and utilize the software's features for various design-related objectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a1a5cc1a53a54df5bb42dbbbe4bf2a83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd31efff73cdeece22a05f5ec7b51a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9140c7e37e0119b4916e696ae874b1df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3e6f28287259d0bcd1778bef739c9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae39c7fc1b40701feec8ea72fdb321fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8f18975f423b4d0916b90c97cb2236c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242671b45a0e910796d44927a20cbcb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3562d6726fa0bbac3b7eebc748987816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8ac3d28483fa91b3321f28d53b3f3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7241e3eb1a806a31bc0ad48080d241b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2fbe5dcc3a4e8a1ae8e11bed963ab43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1649ba5aab72b8db5597324f704210e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf934c5f0b8462bbba8e0190304865a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8e2a7754f043f27de9a47311ba98c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07dd43ed71c883f95d38d5103c641736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d348a021fa662b95c5f1d68673e66bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c926d8f34f6208bc9f906828d61e12a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-292042c431085ac47c7ba6afb3ac599e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d974a3bc11385c7f6ae0b56664a2ef1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121d2b678516eaba15f9dd3dcee2a570&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bba124916d2e6dfe20144108953191a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ec08840c3fa4e52e44aa4c6e2af111&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee4e74ad7f3df71361ec115317cd1fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7a1518e12c82ed346ccdcd608eaf52e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740ef16e2595e0778a42cb1a60595d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bffecc00211cc9cc63c5efef2d67fdee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e44cd8470badba3f8062864e3cf31ed4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-042869791aa7bc0bef8bb8dd20ed4f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dd0f2e5447f7273835565e980268535&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f58e24d8a483d7f261c4371c5734f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0d83d6ec8e5a741ad6b37a2e595b093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196480952649f613e31ae2562603e55f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0938efbf06e3d980c6f900e209b135c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2953dc1c146d2c4762eb62a61e3e10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbffcefc317d0a7ea08df02ff6f2536</data>
