    <node id="Checkbox">
      <data key="d0">Checkbox</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Checkbox refers to a graphical control element that allows users to make binary choices, typically used in settings configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;A checkbox is an interface element that allows users to make a binary choice, indicated as selected in the analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Checkbox refers to the interactive elements in the interface that allow users to select specific structural levels for the architectural model.&lt;SEP&gt;Checkboxes labeled 'Match' and 'From layer, line style' provide options for users to select formatting preferences in the interface.</data>
