    <node id="Software Application">
      <data key="d0">Software Application</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Software Application is a digital tool designed to facilitate a range of user tasks, particularly in contexts like design, architecture, and drawing file management. It provides essential functionalities for navigating and utilizing user interface elements such as Actionbars and palettes, enhancing the user's experience and productivity. The software application incorporates various features aimed at managing library elements, allowing users to filter, sort, and view contents effectively.

Within the platform, users engage with functionalities that support design workflows, including geometric editing tools, precision drawing capabilities, and manipulation of layers. The application enables users to manage their drawing files efficiently, employing tools that assist in snap points, coordinate input, and element manipulation. It is also notable for supporting installation procedures, which are essential for new users to familiarize themselves with the application.

The Software Application encompasses features that handle print functionalities, such as print preview settings, layout assembly, and document management. It aids in batch printing processes and connects effectively with printer drivers to optimize output quality. Overall, the software application serves as a comprehensive technical environment for executing specific tasks within design and architectural frameworks, empowering users with tailored tools and settings for enhanced usability.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-81cf5c85be9f4469f5b46f9f3d23dc66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8832a2783b4ebb13fc2190697157d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dda0e58505c5d8f94593d3a6bf7c79dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5108d2e2b72daaad428ddab42780961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22b0ab29996692a50409c6be635eb1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbe8723d345adc45e60a651c40c23846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ece46ef6a59033ba429c3ebe8b86a98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05cb4111eae86b7e402aebcdf6d4efb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5b26a4db1adef96ce8e4d30ce324263&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3483e846d3a461436f2e30d70ffcc1c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a81260d13723db6a9d85144e65d80ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af697b69b1a7f08ae5fe9fd2b325ad3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5510632c7b84be6bdb3f979a1f2e65de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc0971c8eaf5f4c160edf277f7e06218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-240393128b52ad33196e7809233f13b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22392697d88135ab4dafb424a0ecc181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3f19c90d1575acacdfdc6ee513eb181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-609c972dd436132a0cccc02df2be00b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0dbb6e05a698136a165e1c1e8e4e2a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0df013c9a633cefb28665d1da2e7dac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eba68e2c828547f49fa377ed5fce45d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8373c3e7cc3288907ae08050eaaafba9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28d04c1023b4e291bee112add0bf1f06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c863603b6e414cc25cb96ca43ae6b630&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d199aeaa23602c11381a2a0f4085f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea012b45890e8cbe0fb63b8fc9b1affd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2749bd59130c5cb2654b9e5ade8dc3b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11e6318ef637ac2118c770f1d07667b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd4f98001bcdfeee78fe603290a396e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb1bcbfd08e5e606a0380828f674b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f3f5e2b958b9de1d8184aeca6f12df8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac49db71a2ded8e172c4d75eff9e32af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de8294b9bc8ebeb6f8721e35d9ab4ec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1863d3f8291fd53e99cd9aa0692c462&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bd72ba56dc69681339b2d59b129ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e455ec0d91669cdb1942b077265eaa8</data>
