    <node id="Export Layouts Tool">
      <data key="d0">Export Layouts Tool</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The Export Layouts Tool is a feature within AutoCAD that facilitates the management and exporting of layouts in design software.&lt;SEP&gt;The Export Layouts tool is a feature within the Layout Editor used for exporting layouts in various file formats such as DXF/DWG/DGN.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4613aef76feff60ae50ccfc83b43f347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1710ee37e8dbe9125820f0b81b80de4d</data>
