    <node id="Context">
      <data key="d0">Context</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Context pertains to the surrounding content and environment in which the discarded content appeared, affecting its interpretation and relevance.&lt;SEP&gt;Context refers to the surrounding information and circumstances related to the image and its analysis, including specific software capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Context refers to the surrounding material which provides instructional guidelines for selecting elements, enriching comprehension of the subject matter.&lt;SEP&gt;The surrounding context discusses detailed instructions and guidelines for selecting elements in a diagramming or CAD tool.&lt;SEP&gt;Context refers to the surrounding information that provides significance to the content and its role in discussions about data transfer and management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4613aef76feff60ae50ccfc83b43f347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb80a2d81bd1d72354baf5c14c052e9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b91420bc378d72e2410737951741eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1378ad6e2f07b8979f67c396d166ca62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dd0f2e5447f7273835565e980268535</data>
