    <node id="User Manual">
      <data key="d0">User Manual</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The User Manual is a comprehensive document specifically designed to guide users in understanding and maximizing the functionality of the Allplan 2020 software, which is used for building structure design and management. This manual encompasses detailed sections that cover various aspects of the software, including installation guidelines, tool navigation, and usage instructions.

Within the User Manual, users will find thorough instructions on core functionalities, such as exporting and importing files, print settings, and clipboard functionalities. It aims to help users effectively utilize both basic and advanced features related to design software, including efficient project workflows and task management functions. Additionally, it includes information on specific capabilities like entering polylines, managing graphical elements, and utilizing symbols, as well as features pertinent to PythonParts integration.

The User Manual also emphasizes the layout customization and operational procedures necessary for interacting with architectural and graphical elements, particularly within the context of 3D modeling tools. It serves as a structured reference, outlining essential guidance on installation, user interactions, and software setup, enabling users to harness the full potential of Allplan 2020 for their design projects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60924b3ac3c586e850d1e42321678547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d7adf0f26ef1d1fb72de6d793184a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae39c7fc1b40701feec8ea72fdb321fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfe9f0600b71ac1fb6333f1bc72307a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7241e3eb1a806a31bc0ad48080d241b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d5cb3b5ba0eda3d9ed26299e8ad89b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f93dfe57c8fc90fa6d294b523bed3995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e9951ddc7536ab2c03c5dbe94dbcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11b326d3a55107d559c57ad85195adb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e675b87c12904efc6da74808a3b1481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34bf5f454cde4e8bc980db586539c9ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d199aeaa23602c11381a2a0f4085f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a976eb42894b237c4b0bbd33b7b6c78a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4034b1566017cc79f73d3679724b10d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9f60b9aafff7f66fa66003b4db86794&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4e2272b1efb46881f7e3b630f869774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-632f2bad21fab432a2631e3d244f40fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e54809382d7a16c184591f1d6ef4fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd7e68faef5a44c498363c7227d75afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4526a3914ff00c77819d612514b265fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f8869f86a20dcf25febc09d9d190707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e69ed5796d131fcca1f36d61c827b5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa85df84508902d64c745cd42fb19ecb</data>
