    <node id="Selecting Elements">
      <data key="d0">Selecting Elements</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Selecting elements is a specific action involved in interacting with screen displays in design software.&lt;SEP&gt;Selecting Elements is proposed as a topic likely intended to introduce methods for selecting elements in a user interface.&lt;SEP&gt;Selecting Elements appears to introduce a tutorial or guide on methods for selecting elements in graphical or software interfaces, emphasizing the importance of understanding these techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Selecting elements refers to a subtopic within a section discussing selection mechanisms in graphical modeling or CAD software.&lt;SEP&gt;Selecting Elements is a discarded content that introduces the topic of filtering elements in a digital design environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Selecting Elements refers to the actions described for choosing elements in the Allplan software, which enhances user interaction with the software.</data>
