    <node id="Fences">
      <data key="d0">Fences</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Fences are another method employed in user interfaces to facilitate the selection of items or regions.&lt;SEP&gt;Fences are a selection technique that allows users to define arbitrary areas for selecting elements in a user interface.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b97614e25388842c30e39c49a1e82bc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bea4ecbf369f8e5a0a1e8e93a7608c9</data>
