      <data key="d0">Architecture and Building Information Modeling</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Architecture and building information modeling refer to the broader context in which IFC functionalities are discussed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5524a804838c54b1bc6356af1c661a00</data>
