    <node id="Selection Tools">
      <data key="d0">Selection Tools</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Selection Tools are instruments or methods used in design tasks to select elements within a graphic design environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Selection Tools are functionalities that assist users in selecting and manipulating elements within the library and user interface.&lt;SEP&gt;Selection Tools refer to methods used in design software to choose elements effectively, enhancing user interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Selection Tools pertains to software interface elements discussed in relation to the importance of organized information.&lt;SEP&gt;Selection tools refer to features or techniques that facilitate the selection of elements in diagramming or CAD applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Selection tools refer to functionalities related to element selection in design software, involving various methods like fully bounded, intersected, or direction-based selections.&lt;SEP&gt;Selection Tools refer to features in a graphical interface that allow users to select items or elements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1169d7ca37ca50c76f10adced882a3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb80a2d81bd1d72354baf5c14c052e9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b91420bc378d72e2410737951741eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dd9aa94aab594fbf7969b531d375552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8883fcdbd41f072d6fd0c695f0e43edb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff9c722e93e778ad66cf93e8f94e3d41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef06de7e10a2aa7e4cdbc38635d7cd1</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896650</data>
      <data key="d6" />
