    <node id="Element Selection Methods">
      <data key="d0">Element Selection Methods</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Element Selection Methods include various techniques such as clicking, using selection rectangles, and entering boundaries for effective selection.&lt;SEP&gt;Element Selection Methods involve techniques for selecting elements within a user interface.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1169d7ca37ca50c76f10adced882a3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8883fcdbd41f072d6fd0c695f0e43edb</data>
