      <data key="d5">1763896651</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Industry Foundation Classes">
      <data key="d0">Industry Foundation Classes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Industry Foundation Classes are used within the framework of building data modeling and facilitate data exchanges in architectural applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Industry Foundation Classes (IFC) is a framework for data exchange and interoperability in building and construction industry.&lt;SEP&gt;Industry Foundation Classes is a standard data model used in the construction and facility management industry for data sharing and interoperability.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cfd5486af7f9ff4527914b521a77c5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce92e143f5297f822784332e9a45775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339eac5c9ecfb216780c5a1fee83cfd9</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896651</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Architectural Software">
      <data key="d0">Architectural Software</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Architectural Software is a category of applications specifically designed for the creation and drafting of buildings and architectural elements. It encompasses a wide range of functionalities, including tools for property management, design, and structural analysis, which are essential for architects and engineers in their professional activities.

This software includes features that allow users to insert or modify planes, manage structural levels, and input values for grid dimensions, all of which are crucial for accurate drafting. It also utilizes libraries and default settings to optimize the workflow, enabling efficient design processes. Proper installation guidelines are necessary for the effective use of these applications, ensuring that users can fully leverage the capabilities offered.

Architectural Software plays a vital role in managing architectural projects and workflows within the built environment. It is tailored specifically for the architectural design process, enhancing the ability to visualize and implement design concepts. The integration of various design tools within Architectural Software reinforces its importance in project management and workflow facilitation for those working in architecture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5052fbe47433325630129ce02ea9467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4537c77961461a375e238a73a8da24ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-916b361a8f27ae8dddeb444aa89deb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f1266002cbc58170c89b43e5a6ce03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db592e9ac80503b99b6acc8dacc38ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56531667c1765cb7511766ae395694b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12af230f97935fb21664cc17d2d00177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b5581edd6a5150ce2ec40420195a45b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62793877b09c086c32620ffe91719d5</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896651</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
