    <node id="BIM Processes">
      <data key="d0">BIM Processes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">BIM processes involve integrating user-friendly interfaces and automation to streamline design workflows within the context of building information modeling.&lt;SEP&gt;BIM (Building Information Modeling) Processes reflect essential practices for data management, highlighting the need for thorough documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;BIM Processes refer to the methodologies used for building information modeling, which includes the management of data in construction projects.</data>
