    <node id="IFC Data Management">
      <data key="d0">IFC Data Management</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">IFC Data Management involves the detailed specifications concerning the import and export processes of data using the Industry Foundation Classes framework, focusing on formats, attributes, and types.&lt;SEP&gt;IFC data management pertains to the processes involved in handling Industry Foundation Class (IFC) data for construction and design.</data>
