    <node id="Graphical Interface">
      <data key="d0">Graphical Interface</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Graphical Interface refers to the digital environment where visual elements and interactions are managed.&lt;SEP&gt;A Graphical Interface is a user interface that allows users to interact with a computer system visually, often through icons and symbols.&lt;SEP&gt;A graphical interface is a user interface that allows users to interact with electronic devices through visual indicators, often involving layer management tools.&lt;SEP&gt;The graphical interface of Allplan is designed to enhance user experience through a user-friendly approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Graphical Interface pertains to user interface design that allows interaction through visual indicators and elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Graphical Interface denotes the visual elements through which users interact with software and tools.</data>
