      <data key="d0">Instructional Guide</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Instructional Guide refers to documents that explain functionalities and procedures related to software operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Instructional Guide suggests that the discarded content may have been part of a broader educational resource or reference material.&lt;SEP&gt;An Instructional Guide refers to the structured sequence of steps on selection techniques intended to enhance user knowledge and interaction with graphical interfaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8d803210ed885e95265876491d3ab248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fffd6dcb1781d2dd0fe354673bd0122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81f22c5e3620a1555c869882ed19098c</data>
