    <node id="PDF">
      <data key="d0">PDF</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">PDF is a file format that is widely used for sharing documents while preserving the formatting across different platforms.&lt;SEP&gt;PDF is a file format used to present documents in a manner independent of application software, hardware, and operating systems.&lt;SEP&gt;PDF refers to a digital file format represented by the .pdf extension, commonly used for preserving document formatting.&lt;SEP&gt;PDF is a file format used for capturing and sending electronic documents in exact intended format, widely used for sharing print-ready documents.</data>
