      <data key="d1">dataformat</data>
      <data key="d2">XML (eXtensible Markup Language) is a markup language that defines a set of rules for encoding documents in a format which is both human-readable and machine-readable.&lt;SEP&gt;XML is a file format represented by the extension .xml, used for data interchange, notably in EDMconnection applications.</data>
