    <node id="Technical Manual">
      <data key="d0">Technical Manual</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A technical manual is a comprehensive guide that outlines functionalities, tools, and methodologies related to specific subjects like design.&lt;SEP&gt;The technical manual provides extensive information on navigating and manipulating library elements within the software.&lt;SEP&gt;The technical manual is a guide detailing tool instructions, usage notes, and interfacing options associated with Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Manual discusses the functionality of the shortcut menu within a design tool, focusing on software interface and user navigation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical Manual is a document that contains detailed information about the features and functionalities of Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;A Technical Manual is a comprehensive guide that provides instructions and details related to a specific subject, often used in technical fields.&lt;SEP&gt;The technical manual focuses on the functionality of Allplan software for architectural modeling.</data>
