    <node id="Bounding Box">
      <data key="d0">Bounding Box</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Bounding Box is a term that encapsulates various applications of spatial positioning within documents and digital contexts. It specifically refers to the coordinates outlined in discarded content, which denote the spatial location of elements within a document layout. These coordinates provide a rectilinear area that represents where specific content, such as symbols, text, or images, is situated on a page.

In the context of graphical representation, a Bounding Box typically defines a rectangular area utilizing an array of coordinates to identify its boundaries. For instance, the Bounding Box may be represented by coordinates such as [698, 157, 769, 176] or [914, 63, 935, 77], indicating precise placements of discarded content on specific pages within a document. This functionality extends to user interfaces, where Bounding Boxes delineate areas associated with particular elements in visual applications, enhancing navigation and interaction.

Moreover, the term is frequently applied across multiple sections of a document, indicating various items, including blank text or numeric information like '255'. Each Bounding Box serves as a visual cue, helping users understand the structure and organization of content. For example, in addition to the mentioned coordinates, the Bounding Box can denote locations such as [791, 63, 881, 77], marking the positioning of relevant content in the document. 

Overall, the concept of Bounding Box is essential for indicating the spatial and structural context of elements in a graphical or digital layout, particularly as it relates to discarded content, making it a critical tool in document design and software user interfaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30c83c1aef60ad63396f927675cd8127&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0b62285a51933349adc8e75ee682b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eadc794aece38739eedfec3d3e2cc36a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e37b1e474cd2faf826e95300350e65c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3a535c9c5ef2a4d0721cd95aa6d0830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eee637b59b6ed6c157aae67c5875def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d14420ea310712e7951bafcf032e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e9951ddc7536ab2c03c5dbe94dbcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d89ad56abb5fd0a97f1f499e2775b654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-928205bd70b27c1de0be77bfebc5e054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c863603b6e414cc25cb96ca43ae6b630&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6342e07d4b235a9755572b43ce9f8191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6305991c87e2aa8325819c0131742758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b6098bffd185c3bd19272d3191b788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-578e3db6d41d42574729c44d3fde6a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9e143bbb0781977a04fcd604ac05e33</data>
