    <node id="Document">
      <data key="d0">Document</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Document is a comprehensive written material that encompasses organized technical information pertaining to Allplan software, serving as a crucial resource for users. It includes structured sections addressing various topics such as installation procedures, system requirements, and specific software functionalities, with an emphasis on aiding users in effectively utilizing the software.

The Document provides detailed instructions regarding the installation of Allplan 2020, although there are sections, such as the heading for 'Installation', that lack further elaboration. It serves as a reference point for project data management within the user interface and represents the current file in Allplan, identifiable by a number displayed in the title bar. Moreover, it delineates instructions related to lay-out components and discusses layout editing and printing, reinforcing an organized approach to presenting information.

In addition, the Document encompasses content on architectural representation, detailing patterns and scales relevant to design processes. It discusses the applications and significance of smart symbols and SmartPart technology in Allplan 2020, analyzing their creation and utility within 3D modeling. The content also includes instructions on point snapping techniques in a CAD environment, enhancing precision in drawing and object manipulation.

The Document is structured to allow easy navigation, with an index serving as a reference point for users seeking specific information. It contains points regarding structural levels and height settings in building modeling, and addresses the management of drawing files, supporting users in maintaining efficient workflows. Overall, the Document is an essential resource for those utilizing Allplan software, offering a wealth of information that aligns with technical and creative aspects of design.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ee1b2c794ab3e4a39960b9797ed5aab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5fe2190ad2824592679067ef7e08429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7576b0f6d50859be2257a4b41e1e65f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-543c44a4e6acbf57aa1ec79316bc9510&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0fdcae1fb9712e5a27ca1634779dc11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed59463fa8f100574963a839714cf2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0c100b013d9494004b8d5886c9ede3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9065c1f73abcf0ca1f818394fcc0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e055a4ec3b89b6134bbe368dcda2555c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b0f09d2ce2c133ac20dc536700c0f11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce86500509f57c9f882d9f5f5950e6e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acac71e2cecd52467bce8878a0b269f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86117162ee364c1e083f87e9fa537885&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1369937087e887c6621480db20d1bf7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd686f118216f38a5a9bd617729f6da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6712dbbeb494f7b184f2716b64785e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1882718b5869bbabe6f97218372c273&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a789f6f9ddfb3c5b68ed9d65b75d54e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-199627324ec70005570ae0ac3cd720b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30217a0f03384f817d7f30c9a3010099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6c404c64e4b1ed54d44fbd63a41fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bad7e6be988784a77f8cd26ea5ed266</data>
