    <node id="User Comprehension">
      <data key="d0">User Comprehension</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">User Comprehension pertains to the understanding required by users to effectively engage with the installation and functionalities of the software.&lt;SEP&gt;User comprehension is the understanding and ability of users to grasp or execute the filtering processes explained in the surrounding sections.&lt;SEP&gt;User Comprehension relates to the understanding required by users to effectively utilize the application, which may be hindered by missing foundational content.&lt;SEP&gt;User Comprehension is the understanding and interpretation of the content, which may be affected by the clarity and detail of the information presented.&lt;SEP&gt;User comprehension involves understanding and interpreting instructions provided by software to enhance design workflows.&lt;SEP&gt;User comprehension refers to the understanding and knowledge users gain from interactions with software and its interface.</data>
