      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cancel Button allows users to exit the Find Dialog Box without performing a search.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancel Button is a feature in the Actionbar Configuration interface for aborting actions or discarding changes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancel button is located in the Measured Values dialog box, providing users an option to cancel their changes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancel Button is a function element at the bottom of the Attribute Selection dialog box used to discard changes made by the user.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancel Button in the Import Dialog Box allows users to dismiss the dialog without making any imports or changes.</data>
