    <node id="Software Documentation">
      <data key="d0">Software Documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Software documentation is a structured document that provides users and administrators with instructions and information regarding software use, installation, and features.&lt;SEP&gt;Software Documentation provides detailed technical specifications and instructions on various features, including transparency settings and visibility options.&lt;SEP&gt;Software Documentation refers to the written materials that provide information about software applications, including usage and functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Software documentation including Allplan 2020 typically contains detailed instructions for utilizing software tools and features.&lt;SEP&gt;Software documentation refers to materials that provide detailed information about software capabilities, functionalities, and user guidance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a145ff34e1fe0d010deba2fca752fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3b4f81956c29be44ec682974281e07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79c8ca4654932787c913b81b74b25a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16df2c3b8deab5b6f252494c54478272&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a238b21499e5951f5af21aafc0d71b8</data>
