      <data key="d0">Print Preview Functionality</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Print preview functionality relates to software features that allow users to see a preview of a document or design before printing, incorporating elements like scale and margins.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a145ff34e1fe0d010deba2fca752fde</data>
