    <node id="Design Software Application">
      <data key="d0">Design Software Application</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Design software application refers to software that enables users to create, modify, and analyze visual designs, including viewport features.&lt;SEP&gt;The design software application is implied as the context in which the menu is utilized, focusing on architectural design functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Design Software Application is a platform that includes precision drawing tools and functionalities for accurate point entry in graphic design.&lt;SEP&gt;The design software application is the context in which the object manipulation tools are discussed, likely serving to enhance user interaction with digital designs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Design Software Application is a software that includes various navigation tools, properties, and functionalities relevant to user interface and experience design.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c5284ab6f8d3848eb3123773ca4bfa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005b6256648d782244395cdb0ad71e38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14a15d842e5b5be9c67fc98441bad639&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb6b10894d8b21107453a6a63f8e65c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f953bb379ef3c1fa82a44361051dd131</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896699</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Menu">
      <data key="d0">Menu</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The menu is a vertically oriented toolset displayed in the design software application, containing multiple editing and architectural design options.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c5284ab6f8d3848eb3123773ca4bfa0</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896699</data>
