    <node id="Document Management">
      <data key="d0">Document Management</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Document Management encompasses a comprehensive range of processes and systems aimed at organizing, managing, storing, and retrieving documents effectively, particularly within architectural and design software environments such as Allplan. This entity involves various practices, including the handling of project files and architectural documentation, ensuring that documents are systematically sorted, selected, and accessed.

In the context of software usage, Document Management is essential for navigating and controlling access to numerous document types. It incorporates techniques for the creation, editing, and organization of documents, emphasizing the importance of efficient retrieval and printing outputs. The management of documents includes the use of Object Linking and Embedding (OLE) objects in Allplan, which can enhance the way documents are integrated and manipulated within the project context.

Document Management also plays a crucial role in the broader theme of document handling, which includes practices for finding, sorting, and selecting documents and ensuring consistency and efficiency throughout the document lifecycle. This multidisciplinary approach supports architectural projects by providing effective strategies for managing both physical and digital documentation, thus serving as a backbone for successful design and project execution.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aa75c080b391647ebd8ea4ffd9a169c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-436709514f04a4b2f0c2689b99909af9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33e821c3b421b7baca8cbf0848f0bdab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da4f54485b9020eccb0b77b54a99b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb1cbed0d25d328df8e3a7327cd9307&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f7007492689da90de9479ef1f09d6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c757f29b0cc6308adb48eda300c33068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3961c355840e8904a56b9ae2d568ef8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92300d8d13610cc91f200a7a30321c2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17e81eca64c42f550b12f0f82c5610f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65c4da9217dc97505bc84408f2584901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bc8996e98416f918dd41d6db22638f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3ecf5c3adbf9325efc01db9c8bd48aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-281cf84ade42e93865ebf5c751809d7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68a0b8357864cdeeb4a990f681088c67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567ca0ba9f82e4e0f7175ee8cc803a1b</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
