      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Lock Coordinate is a function in the design software that secures the positioning of elements in the design workspace, with sub-options for Fixed X, Fixed Y, and Fixed Z.&lt;SEP&gt;Lock Coordinate is another feature mentioned in the shortcut menu overview, relevant to the functionalities of the tools discussed.</data>
