    <node id="Point of Intersection">
      <data key="d0">Point of Intersection</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Point of Intersection is a tool for identifying where two or more design elements meet within the design software.&lt;SEP&gt;Point of Intersection is a tool function within the Allplan software for determining where two lines or paths cross.&lt;SEP&gt;Point of Intersection is a feature outlined in the shortcut menu overview related to tools, although specific details are not provided in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Point of Intersection is a snap method that assists users in selecting the intersection point between two elements.</data>
