    <node id="Midpoint">
      <data key="d0">Midpoint</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Midpoint is a tool that calculates the central point between two design elements in the software.&lt;SEP&gt;The midpoint is a specific point on a line segment that is equidistant from both endpoints, often used in geometry and CAD applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Midpoint is a snap method that finds the midpoint of a specified element or line in CAD operations.</data>
