    <node id="User Interface Design">
      <data key="d0">User Interface Design</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">User Interface Design encompasses the creation of user-friendly interfaces to enhance usability and access within software applications.&lt;SEP&gt;User interface design refers to the process of designing interfaces that facilitate user interaction with software, crucial for functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;User Interface Design encompasses the methodology and strategies directed at creating efficient and user-friendly interfaces in software.&lt;SEP&gt;User interface design refers to the creativity and structure involved in organizing design tools within the software for user accessibility and effectiveness.</data>
