      <data key="d0">Project Structure</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Structure refers to the systematic arrangement of project-related data and documents within the Allplan software context.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Structure involves organizing files and managing data hierarchically within Allplan.</data>
