      <data key="d2">回is a single character that translates to 'return' or 'back' in English and appears in the context of a design software instructional material.&lt;SEP&gt;The character '回' translates to 'return' or 'to go back' in Chinese but lacks functional context within the surrounding content.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c09617e15dd11f9c3628b9ef27539f55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3635cb058949af2a97c6e77f4de7d81d</data>
