    <node id="Chinese Character 器">
      <data key="d0">Chinese Character 器</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Chinese character '器' means 'device' or 'instrument' in English and is relevant to discussions about tools and functionalities related to 3D modeling.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4053b391a6a6cb6d07e5301f59184d0b</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896714</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Design Tools">
      <data key="d0">Design Tools</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Design Tools are a collection of instruments and software applications designed to assist users in creating, modifying, and analyzing visual content. These tools offer a range of functionalities, including precision drawing, snapping features, and techniques that facilitate both basic and advanced design processes. 

Within the context of architectural design, Design Tools not only support the creation of layouts and drawings but also include methods for value input and grid dimension management, making them essential in developing precise and intricate designs. In terms of visual editing, Design Tools encompass features that enhance customization through the Actionbar Configuration, thereby improving the user interface experience during design navigation.

Additionally, Design Tools are integral in various design modes, involving commands and applications that contribute to intuitive design processes. The smart symbols introduced in software like Allplan 2020 have further expanded the capabilities offered by Design Tools, highlighting the continuing evolution of these applications to meet user needs effectively. Overall, Design Tools play a crucial role in the modern design landscape, providing both the basic and advanced features required for professional-grade visual creations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7fffd6dcb1781d2dd0fe354673bd0122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-747d43bb486b1d392558683770faea65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12af230f97935fb21664cc17d2d00177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0386115ae26e321feecb48cffce34026&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6712dbbeb494f7b184f2716b64785e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450a009effcf289fffe7290019181323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-798c3d5bcda492510a7e0347ecda7791&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-486fae4c137be122764c551c6470c78c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c6b1e47ccd8e9b3f6cace8ca796bc49</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896714</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
