      <data key="d0">Instrument</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The term 'Instrument' is synonymous with the Chinese character '器' and relates to tools or devices used in various contexts, including 3D modeling.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4053b391a6a6cb6d07e5301f59184d0b</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763896714</data>
      <data key="d6" />
