      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Page 231 contains introductory content about managing drawing files within Allplan, providing essential guidance for new users.&lt;SEP&gt;Page 231 contains important information regarding the organization and management of drawing files, and how they interact visually.&lt;SEP&gt;Page 231 is referenced in the analysis as it discusses the operational context of drawing files in architectural design, highlighting the importance of file management.</data>
