      <data key="d0">Menu Options</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Menu Options refer to the various items listed within the Drop-Down Menu, allowing user selection for different functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;Menu Options refers to various selectable items presented in a shortcut menu, providing different functionalities to the user.</data>
