    <node id="Dialog Boxes">
      <data key="d0">Dialog Boxes</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The dialog boxes depicted in the software interface are used for selecting architectural design parameters such as thickness and material options.&lt;SEP&gt;Dialog boxes are interface elements mentioned in the context of Allplan's management of drawing files, crucial for user interaction and workflow processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dbbd564c80da8a545228ae041a60c486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9138f9804e5b8156f4540c63e24f1fde</data>
