    <node id="Lighting">
      <data key="d0">Lighting</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lighting in the context refers to the uniform illumination seen in interface icons, contributing to clarity in visual representation.&lt;SEP&gt;Lighting describes the flat lighting condition typical for digital icons, indicating the absence of shadows or depth.&lt;SEP&gt;Lighting is a specific functionality within the 3D modeling context that may be relevant in conjunction with Allplan.</data>
