    <node id="Black Diagonal Line">
      <data key="d0">Black Diagonal Line</data>
      <data key="d1">visualelement</data>
      <data key="d2">The Black Diagonal Line stretches from the bottom left to the top right corners of the rectangular shape, serving as a reference for diagonal measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Diagonal Line is a composition in the diagram indicating a design alignment from the lower-left to upper-right.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-56e0d709a61c2954fff181af06317028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cf46b5a3fc83bc2d54d8b624f0b0c5d</data>
