    <node id="Diagram">
      <data key="d0">Diagram</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Diagram is a visual representation that encompasses various functionalities and concepts related to design software. It illustrates several key features, including point snapping functionality, linear snapping, and geometric relationships, facilitating user understanding in a technical context.

One aspect of the Diagram highlights point snapping and linear snap through intersecting lines and marked elements, showcasing how these functionalities operate within the design interface. It also encompasses representations of design software principles with multiple lines and symbols, demonstrating the intricacies involved in the design process.

In terms of specific elements, the Diagram features geometric shapes and measurement tools that are vital in design software environments, facilitating visualization and analysis. Colored lines and segments are employed to represent geometric relationships clearly and effectively, adhering to a technical aesthetic.

Further, the Diagram includes segments showcasing equal angles of a circle to explain geometric concepts effectively. It also depicts two rectangular sections with hatching patterns, which illustrate the idea of adjusting to scale in layout, complete with specific scale denominations for clarity.

Additionally, the Diagram presents a structure of a Smart Symbol, detailing the arrangement and connection of its various layers in a design environment. It effectively organizes and reflects the hierarchical relationship of drawing files using overlapping squares with numerical identifiers, thus providing an organized representation of design assets. 

Collectively, the Diagram serves as a comprehensive educational tool, encapsulating essential design functionalities and geometric principles relevant to users engaged in design software.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-471a28c31749d23bb6aca95f45a148c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdd711c9b6431d785535d73247e2b176&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b9abb9383befc74a21a14f25e4d850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d17b97179f4873945c42823906af40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e345697d6ea758737ad13d83a73b299a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01313bfcae15245d50297b37059f3b16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9dd5e5bce8ecf7d03dc504847d7a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2b5bb83eda7ecfe00cf43d0790bf756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efa2c94792e08136163d0b198a08a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4735f5b73b21ed88ccb63c5cde381b8</data>
