    <node id="Software Manual">
      <data key="d0">Software Manual</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Software Manual provides instructions and functionalities related to the use of Allplan 2020, particularly in architectural design.&lt;SEP&gt;The Software Manual provides guidance and instructions on using the software and likely includes visual representations for user assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Software Manual is a documentation resource that provides instructions and information about using software and its features.&lt;SEP&gt;The Software Manual contains guidance intended to assist users in using various functions of the software.&lt;SEP&gt;Software Manual serves as the broader context within which the installation and operational procedures are discussed and explained.&lt;SEP&gt;The software manual provides instructions and visual aids related to the Allplan software, including various dimensional settings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96f432670260a4683e8787869f7b743b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea6874f69449311da64044dd62af723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc8d88526e9108bd7399a03dfe87aff8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5201dfdc74ffefb5afea6252e9430709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d9d18c0230698c238bcccbc3732f826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11e49830f1c778854c72d2c7213a189b</data>
