    <node id="User Guide">
      <data key="d0">User Guide</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The user guide is a document that provides operational details and instructions for utilizing the Actionbar Configurator.&lt;SEP&gt;The user guide is related to the Allplan 2020 software, providing detailed instructions for using its features and functions.&lt;SEP&gt;The User Guide includes a comprehensive approach to user navigation and structure within Allplan and Bimplus.&lt;SEP&gt;The user guide contains information and instructions regarding the use of software features, including viewport tools.&lt;SEP&gt;The User Guide is a document meant to instruct users on mouse operations and related functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;The user guide is a document intended to assist users in understanding and effectively utilizing design or CAD software functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;The term User Guide refers to documentation intended to assist users in understanding how to effectively set up and utilize digital tools or software.</data>
