    <node id="Instructions">
      <data key="d0">Instructions</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Instructions are critical guidelines provided in the preceding pages, essential for navigating the design application but disrupted by omitted content.&lt;SEP&gt;Instructions provide guidance on utilizing standard viewport arrangements and creating floating viewports in Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;Instructions provide detailed guidance on the manipulation of viewports within the Allplan software environment, emphasizing setup and flexibility in design management.&lt;SEP&gt;Instructions refer to the guidelines provided for extracting entities and relationships from the input text.&lt;SEP&gt;Instructions pertain to the guidelines for understanding and executing polygonization techniques in the architectural design context.</data>
