    <node id="Table">
      <data key="d0">Table</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Table is a versatile data representation tool used in design software, particularly within architectural projects managed in Allplan. It provides extensive structured overviews showcasing various project-related data, including project metadata, 3D object attributes, and layer management commands. 

Moreover, the Table systematically categorizes mouse interactions, detailing actions linked to mouse button functionality and their respective outcomes, which are essential for users operating in a digital design environment. It also organizes keyboard shortcuts that are pivotal for navigating and optimizing tasks within a 3D modeling workspace, enhancing usability and efficiency.

The Table contains structured summaries that encapsulate the functionalities of software tools pertinent to drawing tasks, alongside detailed descriptions of different handle types employed for object manipulation, such as moving, resizing, and deleting elements. Furthermore, it provides valuable insights into display sequence settings within Allplan, identifying visibility parameters based on creation or modification order.

Included also are visual representations of layer statuses, which utilize icons and explanations to illustrate access rights and state descriptions within the layer management system, contributing to enhanced project workflow and organization. Lastly, the Table addresses cursor functions relevant to document management, clarifying actions such as copying and moving documents to streamline user processes. 

Overall, the Table serves as a comprehensive and structured guide for users engaged in architectural design, facilitating understanding and interaction with various elements in their respective software environments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dff3ffeae8a699e76e65ae626562059e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066285e75861d3826b454c75c37304d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f80395b07807004c6e77d6b981b3a9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d66b0c1cc0e3a04b3d3716ebb8c3e26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1be1782cf19027851f94de5abece6998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43da9c48f26a42e9668f66534481e33a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5eb8054aa416fc36085a64f4f7a82fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-806857ad16f04f90832aaa4de2b8b726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-886d493f4d1ef162aa3d5e7a25cd7147&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a1456c27e7c81b4c91906bcd9684b69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a61ccb6676dd29927dd71994c7903dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bc7d14abd3d60dc45c8a51bce1f5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3ecf5c3adbf9325efc01db9c8bd48aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0c62e89bb537033967978d67742f8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af5f603a18868c143aed40d5faf10d64</data>
      <data key="d4">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
