      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">User Interface Customization refers to the adjustments users can make within Allplan to modify tool visibility and organization to enhance efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;User Interface Customization involves adjusting settings and features in the software interface to improve user experience and navigation.&lt;SEP&gt;User interface customization involves the ability to adapt and personalize the interface, enhancing user experience and navigation.&lt;SEP&gt;User Interface Customization pertains to adjusting elements within software to improve user experience and efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;User Interface Customization pertains to tailoring the graphical interface to improve user interaction and design workflows.</data>
