      <data key="d2">User Control is the ability of users to manage display elements and settings for better efficiency in design workflows.&lt;SEP&gt;User Control refers to the ability of users to manage and organize graphical representations in design software, essential for achieving clarity and usability.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8760942d27bd57853f623d22dcb381ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f68a34d6b8f20b0ca016139d95828c0</data>
