    <node id="Viewport Management">
      <data key="d0">Viewport Management</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Viewport Management refers to the functionality and set of processes within Allplan software that enables users to configure, control, and optimize various views of their projects. It encompasses the methods and techniques used for effectively utilizing and arranging viewports, which are essential for navigating design entities within the software interface. Through viewport management, users can enhance their interaction with the software by employing specific tools and features that improve usability and design efficiency.

The system of viewport management involves several functionalities aimed at refining the user experience. These include the organization and manipulation of viewing panels, which may involve techniques such as floating and docking viewports. Such features allow for flexible arrangements of multiple viewports, facilitating multitasking and an overall improved design workflow.

In the context of Allplan, viewport management plays a pivotal role in the display of models, allowing users to adjust how different components are visualized. By effectively controlling the viewing area and employing various display settings, users can enhance comprehension and interaction with their designs. Overall, viewport management is a comprehensive process that combines user interface design considerations with practical tools for efficient project management within the Allplan software environment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f556f8e100c6e0be99790528f7e4185d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb155c6158111cf7bdff79095dc33a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e495b0cd79cc88f595fa746df2e7844&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1531f3518c2d5fa3c2f8c42e7c04cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e69ed5796d131fcca1f36d61c827b5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-539a0a9dff7748fb5aafc103f58f621f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f222b17869ec7f559ec4317d58ddca19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60190843a0f358ee5d312009e08ebfba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c31e5d279b3f3068c566e1b7da435ef5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a8db8e073e31105e77def48046bfd98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-910efe40ae420cf9a62bc952e98be475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e60e08936a9c34cbeef4c292ce8e7f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-358d68c967093242b5133c5fa8afa3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-458403f15b2d9bab2a2119812d7270b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89bf18f5014389411cb4f93ca7ac29b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ea3cf9156a4c203bc69b1b2c68207c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58f102a1dd1d5b104b36b03b0afb5e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e99a1900958135051554ed048311c31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eac8f8da1f1ce7d56cbf997897879d37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a29dbcc162863944da5d705e82881319&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fa30709ea511dd65978c34d2c2d2663&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53b9ad8a6d84eb752226ea40b24a30f4</data>
