    <edge source="Bimplus" target="Allplan">
      <data key="d7">17.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Allplan and Bimplus are integrated software platforms that enhance project management and collaboration within the construction and design sectors. Allplan is primarily focused on providing an environment conducive to architectural design, while Bimplus extends this functionality by integrating additional tools and resources, improving user experience and project handling capabilities.

The integration of Bimplus into Allplan significantly enhances various aspects of project management, including task management and project synchronization. Users benefit from improved collaborative functionalities, which facilitate better workflow management across design projects. Allplan utilizes the capabilities of Bimplus to address needs such as task guidance, project coordination, and comprehensive instruction sets tailored for architectural projects. 

These systems work in synergy to create a robust environment where project management tasks are streamlined, allowing for effective administration of construction assignments. Bimplus also plays a crucial role in aiding Allplan users in managing databases, such as inserting profiles into the Allplan library, which enhances data management.

Overall, the collaboration between Allplan and Bimplus provides a cohesive and efficient framework that supports architects and project managers in navigating their responsibilities, leading to better-organized, more successful project outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d9">collaboration,data management,functionality,integration,integration relevance,operational efficiency,project collaboration,project management,related platforms,resource integration,software enhancement,software focus,software functionalities,software functionality,software integration,task management,user guidance</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-ec1729b2d3689ebe861c41881a390fc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9af0eeaf763231fe31640b724a22aae9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6dfc54cc34be7df573bffd25060a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdba2226dec5584f6511d77d2b5f7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f8869f86a20dcf25febc09d9d190707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cef00cd9dd33e646387968fe293078f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45b1cabd25f8d210e4eb5c4e96aa039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab8f70749e69cff7fda1de507e6fcdcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44bd59ccbe0cab28616751e2c2cc91e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a4cd03a65b9dc915cec04e3a5dda465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9316bd775f736c37e856046aa7237e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9ce3a00bca11a70ac1a2d1c6fab790e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922e4b9126761633ec085aaac26c430d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f72a6e939a595903d1409e3e058fcf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db6335795188eff6f459d29076d581f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8a08773aa044ab88848760c734b6ca</data>
