    <edge source="Drawing Files" target="Building Structure">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The building structure in Allplan organizes drawing files according to hierarchical design levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The building structure organizes drawing files in a hierarchical framework for efficient project management.&lt;SEP&gt;Drawing files are integral to the design and management of the building structure within Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;Building structure methodologies emphasize the automatic generation of drawing files to enhance efficiency.</data>
