    <edge source="Drawing Files" target="Allplan">
      <data key="d7">12.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Allplan, a software widely utilized in architectural design, manages Drawing Files that hold essential data related to project layouts and designs. These drawing files serve as primary components within Allplan, allowing users to create, save, and structure their design data effectively. 

Within the Allplan software, drawing files facilitate the design and editing process for building projects, playing a critical role in managing and organizing design elements. The functionality for managing these files is vital for architects and designers, ensuring that project structuring is both efficient and comprehensive. Drawing Files possess various statuses that are essential for architectural design, highlighting their importance within Allplan’s overall design management system.

In summary, Allplan's focus on managing Drawing Files underscores their integral role in optimizing the design workflow, enhancing the software's usability in the context of architectural projects.</data>
      <data key="d9">data management,data organization,design management,design process,design tools,file management,project management,project organization,software context,software function,software functionality,software usage</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-a16b1e5756a6e58b24d2d8ec53fdb945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ed2f4c4b8b09ff37fd8fcc9a82daa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a9230f90f86536e2d89709e70964c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-722696e14943f4546267ecafc68e9e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dfa5fe91c361d4a67860ecb32d1a0e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b95a85ff07713cc0f1adb8712b58bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbbd564c80da8a545228ae041a60c486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdaeced48a09bf3e6cabc0558e70ecf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656c6ea66b577915e78e14b99fcff201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0003317cc231a35911e26a266b87c25f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d692d889f45fd000f1ad654707af6f5</data>
      <data key="d11">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d12">1763897361</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
