    <edge source="Building Structure" target="Discarded Content">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Discarded Content fails to provide substantial context or information relevant to the discussion surrounding Building Structure.&lt;SEP&gt;The Discarded Content lacks necessary information that could aid in understanding the Building Structure concept.&lt;SEP&gt;The discarded content is deemed irrelevant to the broader discussion about building structure attributes due to its lack of context.&lt;SEP&gt;The Discarded Content fails to connect meaningfully with the Building Structure due to insufficient context and missing actionable insights.&lt;SEP&gt;The Discarded Content discusses the Building Structure but lacks completeness and relevance to its integration with plane models.</data>
