    <edge source="Quick Access Toolbar" target="Allplan">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation name is Allplan and its Quick Access Toolbar. The Quick Access Toolbar is a significant feature within the Allplan software designed to enhance user accessibility to frequently utilized tools. It allows for user customization, enabling individuals to tailor their interface according to their specific needs, thereby improving interaction with the software and overall workflow efficiency.

This toolbar serves as an integral component of Allplan’s user interface, ensuring that essential tools are readily available for users. By incorporating the Quick Access Toolbar, Allplan facilitates swift access to tools relevant to various tasks, including managing viewports. This enhancement not only streamlines the user experience but also underscores Allplan’s commitment to usability and accessibility, making it a vital asset for architects and planners who rely on the software for their projects.</data>
      <data key="d9">accessibility,application feature,customization,interface element,software feature,tool access,tool accessibility,usability,user accessibility,user interface,workflow enhancement</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-87aecad85380c390cbc2374858405d69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712ac7e367720bf0768cb3b167957363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-575138ede49e6b4257478409c025e498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a244da62e429c7705c53c4c5a40d7e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4faf10764600594e5d98531e142dd907&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d099869dd762f58622ec8ec268721766&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b4cbb8c7ca0283957c1c36f9d33a212&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cfbdcd286fb30bd430a5f20fdd1dcf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecda41be318a51a07214b73099fcb56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ea3cf9156a4c203bc69b1b2c68207c7</data>
      <data key="d11">Allplan_2020_Manual.pdf</data>
      <data key="d12">1763898649</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
