    <edge source="Allplan" target="Actionbar">
      <data key="d7">15.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Actionbar is an essential user interface component integrated into the Allplan software application, which serves multiple pivotal roles in aiding users during their design processes. Primarily, the Actionbar facilitates access to a variety of tools and functionalities necessary for efficiently performing design tasks within Allplan. It streamlines user navigation through the software interface by organizing these tools and enhancing user interaction and task management.

As a critical element of Allplan's user interface, the Actionbar enhances the overall functionality of the software. Its design includes editing options and customization features that significantly improve user accessibility to the necessary design functionalities. By incorporating the Actionbar, Allplan aims to provide a more cohesive and user-friendly experience, ensuring users can easily navigate and utilize the tools at their disposal. 

Overall, the Actionbar is a fundamental feature that contributes to the usability and effectiveness of Allplan in the architectural design field, proving to be an indispensable resource for users navigating the software's various design tasks.</data>
      <data key="d9">editing options,feature accessibility,feature functionality,functionality,interface component,interface design,navigation,navigation aid,software application,software feature,software functionality,software interface,software organization,tool access,tool functionality,tool management,ui component,usability,user interface</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-63113ce4c55fd340029d2a7657821c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82cbcdc0a3c08b89e366f56c7b12be7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b532fa4a8ab92ded3fea1d57304eeffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc2e5e1cca4bececa7176b1cd5853d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f1c1dffb20e9037822fb3685bc70cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b8c205c8612c072166b688afee2ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fdd44bd887b5adeb1adf20548cfb587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bba124916d2e6dfe20144108953191a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329b078a4f7ec71384ebf557857c6e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e6b80e48bef3738c39a27291a07173f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7aa60924b27638a18e328e8dac3e2719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdba2226dec5584f6511d77d2b5f7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2811ca6e09d4513b3fef90682a011dbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0e957393684b272e0278e8a908a2f09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f401ead0c0a7da4fd8575f768c665a0f</data>
