    <edge source="Allplan" target="SmartParts">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Allplan, a software solution for architectural design and building information modeling (BIM), incorporates SmartParts as integral components aimed at improving the modeling of intelligent CAD (Computer-Aided Design) objects. SmartParts serve as specialized tools within the Allplan environment, specifically designed for various tasks associated with design and construction. 

The integration of SmartParts within Allplan enables users to leverage advanced functionalities that enhance the usability and effectiveness of the software during CAD design processes. These tools facilitate efficient creation and manipulation of objects, thereby optimizing workflows and streamlining tasks within design projects.

By employing SmartParts, Allplan not only improves design capabilities but also promotes consistency throughout the architectural design workflow. This technology is crucial for object management, empowering users to engage in parametric modeling, which allows for greater flexibility and precision in architectural designs. Overall, SmartParts are essential to Allplan, significantly enhancing the software's ability to meet the demands of modern design challenges.</data>
