    <edge source="Allplan" target="File Management">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">File Management is a primary focus within the Allplan application aimed at enhancing efficiency in managing project files.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan facilitates file management, enabling users to organize data and documents effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;File Management practices are implemented within Allplan to enhance document organization and project structuring.&lt;SEP&gt;Allplan facilitates effective file management, which is essential for successful print operations and layout management.</data>
