    <edge source="Actionbar" target="User Interface">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The User Interface serves as a bridge to the Actionbar's tool organization within Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar serves a purpose within the User Interface of the software application, impacting how users interact with it.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar is a key component of the User Interface, aiding in user tasks and interactions within the software.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar is a key component of the user interface that includes various tools organized into categories.&lt;SEP&gt;The User Interface provides context for the Actionbar, supporting navigation and user engagement.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar is a component of Allplan's user interface that facilitates various functions and palette usage.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar serves as a functional component within the user interface, providing tools for selection.</data>
