    <edge source="User Interface" target="Palettes">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Palettes are integral components of the user interface, enhancing usability within Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;Palettes are integral parts of the user interface that assist in user navigation within Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;Palettes are essential components within the user interface that facilitate color and tool selection for design tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Palettes contribute to the user interface by supporting navigation and access to features in the software.&lt;SEP&gt;Palettes serve as an organizational role in the user interface of the software application, facilitating design tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Palettes serve to organize components within the user interface, enhancing user interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Palettes contribute to navigation and tool access aspects of the User Interface, highlighting their importance in software design.</data>
