      <data key="d8">The effectiveness of the user interface influences overall usability, determining how engaged users are with Allplan's functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;The user interface of Allplan is designed with a focus on usability to enhance overall user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;The user interface's design significantly affects its usability, determining how users interact and learn from Allplan.&lt;SEP&gt;The effectiveness of the User Interface contributes directly to its Usability, emphasizing the importance of intuitive design.</data>
