    <edge source="Allplan Software" target="Installation, Basics">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation "Allplan Software, Installation, Basics" pertains to the introductory section that focuses on the essential steps and foundational knowledge necessary for the installation of Allplan software. This section is designed to guide new users through the fundamental installation processes, ensuring they have the necessary understanding to effectively utilize the software.

The "Installation, Basics" content serves as an essential resource for users, particularly those who are new to Allplan software. It aims to provide clear and straightforward foundational installation instructions that are critical for users to begin their journey with the software. By understanding these key concepts, users are better equipped to handle the installation process, which is vital for realizing the software's full potential.

Overall, the "Installation, Basics" section emphasizes the importance of introductory guidance in the successful deployment of Allplan software, making it a crucial component for anyone looking to work with this application effectively.</data>
