      <data key="d8">Image Content Analysis assesses the organization and layout of the Software Interface.&lt;SEP&gt;Image Content Analysis evaluates user interactions and functionalities present in the Software Interface.&lt;SEP&gt;The Image Content Analysis examines the Software Interface to provide insights into its design and functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Image Content Analysis investigates the functionalities present in the Software Interface of the Allplan software.</data>
